## Crazyflie 2.x USD asset (NVIDIA Omniverse)

The `crazyflie` platform loads
`{ISAAC_NUCLEUS_DIR}/Robots/Bitcraze/Crazyflie/cf2x.usd` at runtime from
NVIDIA's Nucleus server. It is not redistributed here and is governed by the
NVIDIA Omniverse licence terms.

## Crazyflie Brushless USD assets

`source/isaac_pursuit_evasion/assets/Crazyflie/*.usd` are derived from the
Bitcraze Crazyflie 2.x model above, re-authored for this project with distinct
pursuer/evader materials so the two drones are separable in the segmentation
mask.
